  "description": "VOHKIP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H120 Gd4 N12 O16,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.607-3.897 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.40-112.94°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C136H132Gd4N16O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
